  "h4_status": "partially-supported",
  "h4_note": "D2-check (exact targets) plus E4-lite (trained network): for label RR, a trained noise-aware PFN recovers most of the calibration gain at equal accuracy and costs nothing on clean data. Open: the synthetic-data half of D2, real-data/backbone scale (TabPFN), and the noisiest cell (n=128, eps=0.5), where the network remains under-confident."
